      "message": "This change appears to combine several independent pieces of work that I think would benefit from being split into separate commits. Keeping commits focused on a single logical change makes them easier to review, bisect, and revert when needed.\n\nThe reference topology regeneration (refTopoTapiFullUnidirLink.xml) is grouped together with several unrelated fixes, including the virtual-link mesh loop termination fix in TapiOpticalNode, the ConnectivityUtils map reset, the OpenRoadmServiceCopier active-mode setting, and log cleanup in TapiRendererNotificationHandler, even though those can be reviewed independently.\n\nAs a proposed way forward, I’ve split this into focused commits without\nchanging the implementation. The original authorship has been preserved;\nI only reorganized the changes into separate commits:\n\n- Switch to UNIDIR links in TAPI topology (includes reference topology regeneration)(https://git.opendaylight.org/gerrit/c/transportpce/+/123806)\n- tapi: fix virtual link mesh loop termination https://git.opendaylight.org/gerrit/c/transportpce/+/123807\n- tapi: clear connectionFullMap per service creation https://git.opendaylight.org/gerrit/c/transportpce/+/123808\n- tapi: set active mode in OpenRoadmServiceCopier https://git.opendaylight.org/gerrit/c/transportpce/+/123809\n- tapi: fix logs and remove stale TODOs https://git.opendaylight.org/gerrit/c/transportpce/+/123810",
